# W31c2, b (k10): joins a in stag0201, sees the notice of a's entry and goes along 30 s later (a's floor is ready: the GO
# is stamped at once); its GO barrier is held (the test hook) until a has left dng204b1: b lands alone in dng204b1 in a
# new stage group of a's instance ("Kim left Sand Labyrinth B1 before you arrived."), its seat kept.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@800
log b sees the notice
idle until frames>=1800
goalong until go=stamped or go=going
log b goes along
idle until stage=dng204b1,control fail epoch>=@1000
log b in dng204b1
idle until frames>=900 fail present>=2,stagechange
log b alone in dng204b1 in a's instance
